{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21722","headline":"再酬复言和前篇 · 元稹","name":"再酬复言和前篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经过二郡逢贤牧，聚集诸郎宴老身。\n清夜漫劳红烛会，白头非是翠娥邻。\n曾携酒伴无端宿，自入朝行便别春。\n潦倒微之从不占，未知公议道何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}